WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.580
Hi, I'm Tilly! Let's give one task to three agents.

00:00:05.652 --> 00:00:08.772
The fan command starts one agent for each git worktree.

00:00:09.874 --> 00:00:15.714
Control B, then the closing bracket, visits each one. They all have their own worktree.

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:18.770
Worktree diff shows what one of them changed.

00:00:20.243 --> 00:00:24.643
Keep the best one. The others close, and their work goes to git stash.

00:00:28.036 --> 00:00:31.076
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
